# Density Compare
# Radon (Rn) — real density 0.0097 g/cm³. equal masses: Radon vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Radon Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 93.7mm color: #cc0080 at (-20mm, 46.8mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 0.1 g — the water cube is the reference
